          'SPF Myths Dermatologists Want You to Ignore',
          'Best Moisturizers for Sensitive, Dry Skin'
        ]
      },
      trustPillars: [
        { title: 'For you, by experts', text: 'Our writers and clinicians translate medical evidence into plain-language guidance for everyday life.' },
        { title: 'Built to move you forward', text: 'Every article includes practical next steps so you can take action with confidence.' },
        { title: 'Reviewed by professionals', text: 'Medical reviewers validate claims, context, and safety before publication.' },
        { title: 'Always up to date', text: 'We continually refresh key content as science, guidelines, and treatments evolve.' }
